            <button class="faq-q">
              How long does it take to build a custom terrarium?<span class="ic">+</span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-a">
              <p>
                It depends on dimensions and equipment, but we build most
                terrariums within a few days to two weeks. The exact timeframe
                is agreed upon when ordering.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-q">
              What exactly is included in a kit?<span class="ic">+</span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-a">
              <p>
                Each kit includes the animal, an appropriately sized terrarium
                and basic equipment (substrate, lighting or heater, hideouts -
                depending on the species). The exact contents are listed on each
                kit card.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-q">
              How do I choose the right terrarium for my pet?<span class="ic">+</span>
            </button>
